  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "光景bóng uē - 思念ê子"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: black; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: center;\">思念ê子</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0px;\">/ 鄭玉鳳</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgJ2TvZf2tKGN5v4LZUwqwVdAFnTQfRYy9JsFL2eLYAh713w5zeI42l837Q3b0lhDXGm_fuWpT34XPNwHv92okq7qmWq1n6lN5r-aNrFmkdjKMZSz-AQWeIBtmCBpmJ_1jJjJXs0eCG67snt6mRzeYJokqxcYm7M9jeBRIwJuBjErxIdBGIUi0n-JByGMYb\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 0px 10px; text-align: justify;\">\n        來竹北租田種菜，頭尾六冬，論收成，感覺見笑。種無thang孝孤，極ke收寡蟲食賰--ê、iah是蟲無愛食ê苦菜。Tio̍h蟲、tio̍h病，種無thang收是sù常發生ê代誌。就認份笑笑koh去菜子行交學費。頭家娘真gâu安搭--人，hō͘我信心繼續買菜栽，繼續種就tio̍h--lo͘h。種經驗m̄是搶收成！<br /><br />M̄-koh見擺種lóng送hō͘蟲thōa、露螺、鳥仔食khah大面。年久月深無收成，手mā ē落軟，就改變方式，無愛種oh顧、厚蟲ê菜類，kan-na種苦澀、蟲無愛食ê菜，ke減收來安慰家己，然後用貧惰農法（無chōaⁿ藥、無落肥）調整，有用有機肥來催生，有收菜頭、番薯就chiok暢--ah。<br /><br />細漢tī庄跤，看阮老爸kah庄跤ê厝邊頭尾lóng有家己ê菜園，bē真大phiàn，細細塊仔，種家己食有夠就好--ah。Gâu種--ê koh thang pun人食。逐家lóng tòe節氣種，到分、大出時間lóng仝時chūn。Sio送koh送無路，真心適。<br /><br />Ùi下港搬來新竹，我不時tī厝邊柯子湖溪附近運動散步，見擺看著客人阿婆ê菜園，lóng真欣羨，心內chiok想beh租一塊菜園來種。Hiàng時，阮老爸koh tī--leh，我時常想講來租地種菜，叫阮爸來新竹kā我tàu種，伊定著真歡喜，ē-tàng來新竹牽教查某囝種菜。總--是想bóng想，lóng無出手落去做。一直到阮老爸雄雄破病過身，我chiah後悔萬分，永遠無機會thang hō͘老爸展伊種菜ê工夫。<br /><br />後--來，某種機緣，tī朋友田--裡tàu跤手，開始koh有種菜ê動機。拄好，朋友租ê地beh退租，我就殘殘kā租一分地來種看māi。無m̄-tio̍h，一分地，乞食hē大願，thèng候chiah濟年ê心願，我ê作田夢總算beh起鼓--ah。<br /><br />50歲chiah開始學作穡確實無輕鬆，曝日、蠓仔咬，逐工舞kah真狼狽。本身koh tài身命有關節炎，掘土、沃水bē堪得操過頭。收工了，不時ài食止疼藥來teh。M̄-koh，我iáu是真愛種，綿chiⁿ種，逐擺我屈tī園--裡，阮爸ê形影、聲嗽，就ē浮現tī我ê頭殼底。我ē聽著伊tī園--裡講ê話：「菜股掘無幼，án-ne bē-sái。菜子掖siuⁿ ba̍t，ài緊seng。水沃siuⁿ tâm，無彩手。Hia-ê露螺、紅kha-chhng仔真夭壽，菜栽食了了。」老爸講chia-ê話hit時ê面容、聲音、情緒iáu-koh明明明出現tī我ê眼前。我雖然種無、收無，m̄-koh我逐日種思念。</div><div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 0px 10px; text-align: justify;\"><b><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>思念ê菜子　新竹風透--來<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>飛過頭前溪　飛到蘭陽平原　飛去老爸ê菜園<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>行過冬天　等待春天　chiâⁿ做勇氣！\n    </b></div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 40px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjrKYoXj_wJUTBPNsu8d3MYYKNtLRX5xKPGaZn5mDxlhszDdwK5pfUju_FzwHQyamnz6XfIfoltdTkXQxs0L0IB-lOe4XUsmJ_gEfjJp1DMrMlC0ipugio_S0ObqohWlgLov0Bc07xLvv1qnED4d0IdAxEEgIsBXmUKlKQuB7DFec3bMDJhXZQkORLsl94N\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 382期，2026年01月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
  },
